fed5c00e334a3a49.prompt:
Write one complete phone screen as JSON: {id,title?,components:[{id,c,...props}]}. Use unique snake_case ids for components; never put ids on array items. Use only listed props. Use null for absent optional fields, never write empty strings.

Layout: browse/shelves. Job: Explore shelves of things to open.

Recipe slots: [{"id":"slot1","allow":["Header"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot2","allow":["Search"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot3","allow":["Chips"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot4","allow":["SectionTitle"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot5","allow":["List"],"min":1,"max":1,"variant":"shelf"},{"id":"slot6","allow":["SectionTitle"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot7","allow":["List"],"min":1,"max":1,"variant":"shelf"}]. Match every required slot in order. Variants such as shelf, reply, month or mood are the component's style; Field/Camera variants are kind. prices means every Choice option has a price value; toggle means every List row has trail: toggle.

Screen rules: three to nine components outside overlays, total weight at most twelve, at most two weight-three components. One primary Button at most. Hero first in the body; a SectionTitle needs following content. Repeated types cannot be adjacent except Card and Field. Reply Composer is last after Bubbles. Do not invent color, size or layout props.

Real app content: {"things":[{"type":"plant","fields":["name","room","care"]}],"items":[{"id":"fern","type":"plant","sample":true,"name":"Fern","room":"Bathroom","care":"Water every seven days","photo":"lib:plants"},{"id":"basil","type":"plant","sample":true,"name":"Basil","room":"Kitchen","care":"Water every three days","photo":"lib:plants"},{"id":"monstera","type":"plant","sample":true,"name":"Monstera","room":"Living room","care":"Water every ten days","photo":"lib:plants"}]}

Header: Name the screen and offer one optional shortcut.
props: { style?: large|inline|back="large", title: text≤28, sub?: text≤40, action?: { icon: dot|leaf|drop|dog|cat|calendar|calendar_days|clock|check|chevron_right|plus|minus|close|search|settings|bell|bell_off|heart|star|bookmark|share|send|message|mail|phone|camera|image|video|mic|music|play|pause|square|undo|timer|alarm_clock|sun|moon|cloud|cloud_rain|thermometer|wind|flame|zap|battery|wifi|pin|map|navigation|compass|home|building|store|shopping_cart|shopping_bag|tag|gift|credit_card|wallet|banknote|piggy_bank|receipt|trending_up|trending_down|bar_chart|pie_chart|activity|target|trophy|medal|award|flag|user|users|user_plus|baby|smile|dumbbell|bike|footprints|heart_pulse|pill|stethoscope|apple|coffee|utensils|wine|pizza|carrot|sprout|flower|tree|mountain|waves|car|bus|plane|train|briefcase|graduation_cap|book_open|book|pencil|file_text|clipboard|clipboard_list|checklist|lock|unlock|key|shield|eye|link|paperclip|download|upload|trash|edit|filter|sliders|info|alert|help|sparkles|lightbulb|palette|scissors|wrench|hammer|package|truck|recycle|globe|languages|gamepad|ticket|paw|shirt|bed|bath|sofa|lamp|chevron_left|arrow_left|more|external_link|quote|circle_check, label: text≤16, goto?: id snake_case } }
example: {"c":"Header","style":"large","title":"My plants","sub":"Three need water today","action":{"icon":"plus","label":"Add a plant","goto":"new_plant"}}
weight: 1

Search: Find one thing among many by typing words from its name.
props: { hint: text≤40 }
example: {"c":"Search","hint":"Search plants"}
weight: 1

Chips: Filter things or pick one value from a few short options.
props: { style?: filter|choose="filter", items: [2..6 { label: text≤16, on?: boolean=false, icon?: dot|leaf|drop|dog|cat|calendar|calendar_days|clock|check|chevron_right|plus|minus|close|search|settings|bell|bell_off|heart|star|bookmark|share|send|message|mail|phone|camera|image|video|mic|music|play|pause|square|undo|timer|alarm_clock|sun|moon|cloud|cloud_rain|thermometer|wind|flame|zap|battery|wifi|pin|map|navigation|compass|home|building|store|shopping_cart|shopping_bag|tag|gift|credit_card|wallet|banknote|piggy_bank|receipt|trending_up|trending_down|bar_chart|pie_chart|activity|target|trophy|medal|award|flag|user|users|user_plus|baby|smile|dumbbell|bike|footprints|heart_pulse|pill|stethoscope|apple|coffee|utensils|wine|pizza|carrot|sprout|flower|tree|mountain|waves|car|bus|plane|train|briefcase|graduation_cap|book_open|book|pencil|file_text|clipboard|clipboard_list|checklist|lock|unlock|key|shield|eye|link|paperclip|download|upload|trash|edit|filter|sliders|info|alert|help|sparkles|lightbulb|palette|scissors|wrench|hammer|package|truck|recycle|globe|languages|gamepad|ticket|paw|shirt|bed|bath|sofa|lamp|chevron_left|arrow_left|more|external_link|quote|circle_check }] }
example: {"c":"Chips","style":"filter","items":[{"label":"All rooms","on":true},{"label":"Bathroom"},{"label":"Kitchen"},{"label":"Living room"}]}
weight: 1

SectionTitle: Label a group of content and offer one optional link to more.
props: { text: text≤32, link?: { label: text≤16, goto?: id snake_case } }
example: {"c":"SectionTitle","text":"Needs water","link":{"label":"See all","goto":"plants"}}
weight: 1

List: Several things of the same kind, each one tappable.
props: { style?: plain|inset|cards|shelf|expand|ranked="inset", rows: [1..6 { title: text≤28, meta?: text≤36, icon?: dot|leaf|drop|dog|cat|calendar|calendar_days|clock|check|chevron_right|plus|minus|close|search|settings|bell|bell_off|heart|star|bookmark|share|send|message|mail|phone|camera|image|video|mic|music|play|pause|square|undo|timer|alarm_clock|sun|moon|cloud|cloud_rain|thermometer|wind|flame|zap|battery|wifi|pin|map|navigation|compass|home|building|store|shopping_cart|shopping_bag|tag|gift|credit_card|wallet|banknote|piggy_bank|receipt|trending_up|trending_down|bar_chart|pie_chart|activity|target|trophy|medal|award|flag|user|users|user_plus|baby|smile|dumbbell|bike|footprints|heart_pulse|pill|stethoscope|apple|coffee|utensils|wine|pizza|carrot|sprout|flower|tree|mountain|waves|car|bus|plane|train|briefcase|graduation_cap|book_open|book|pencil|file_text|clipboard|clipboard_list|checklist|lock|unlock|key|shield|eye|link|paperclip|download|upload|trash|edit|filter|sliders|info|alert|help|sparkles|lightbulb|palette|scissors|wrench|hammer|package|truck|recycle|globe|languages|gamepad|ticket|paw|shirt|bed|bath|sofa|lamp|chevron_left|arrow_left|more|external_link|quote|circle_check, photo?: photo lib:<tag>|local:<n>, trail?: none|chevron|check|toggle|value|badge="chevron", value?: text≤10, goto?: id snake_case, body?: text≤200, me?: boolean }] }
Rule: For questions that open in place, use style: "expand" and a body on every row. Do not add goto or meta saying tap for an answer.
Rule: Photo values are references like "lib:plants" or "local:1". Never put the word photo or a space inside the value.
Rule: Icons are optional; omit them when not needed. The water icon is "drop", never "droplet".
Rule: A sideways photo rail uses style: "shelf" and photo on every row; a ranking uses style: "ranked" with each score in value.
example: {"c":"List","style":"inset","rows":[{"title":"Fern","meta":"Bathroom · water today","icon":"leaf","trail":"toggle","goto":"fern"},{"title":"Monstera","meta":"Living room · in two days","icon":"leaf","goto":"monstera"},{"title":"Basil","meta":"Kitchen · freshly watered","icon":"drop","trail":"check","goto":"basil"}]}
weight: 2

A valid default for this layout: {"id":"browse_shelves","components":[{"id":"h1","c":"Header","style":"large","title":"Plant"},{"id":"s1","c":"Search","hint":"Search plants"},{"id":"c1","c":"Chips","style":"filter","items":[{"label":"Fern","on":true},{"label":"Basil","on":false},{"label":"Monstera","on":false}]},{"id":"s2","c":"SectionTitle","text":"Plant"},{"id":"l1","c":"List","style":"shelf","rows":[{"title":"Fern","meta":"Bathroom","photo":"lib:plant"},{"title":"Basil","meta":"Kitchen","photo":"lib:plant"},{"title":"Monstera","meta":"Living room","photo":"lib:plant"}]},{"id":"s3","c":"SectionTitle","text":"Plant"},{"id":"l2","c":"List","style":"shelf","rows":[{"title":"Fern","meta":"Bathroom","photo":"lib:plant"},{"title":"Basil","meta":"Kitchen","photo":"lib:plant"},{"title":"Monstera","meta":"Living room","photo":"lib:plant"}]}]}

